--- OLD
:   JSL rando_enemyai + RANDOFAR
    BCC @UseAi
      JMP ChooseAndAttackPlayer ; no AI -- just attack a random player
    .res 9, $EA                 ; the lookup this replaced was 30 bytes
--- NEW
:   JSL rando_enemyai + RANDOFAR
    BCC @Think
      JMP ChooseAndAttackPlayer ; no AI -- just attack a random player
.import tac_turn
  @Think:
    ;  Boss tactics: a boss weighs its whole turn (tactics.asm), and if it
    ;  decides it does not come back here.  Four of the nine bytes the
    ;  lookup left; the rest fall through to the script.  The name sorts
    ;  after randoai_kraken.patch, whose output this edits.
    JSL tac_turn + TACTICSFAR
    .res 5, $EA
